00:27:09.260 --> 00:27:12.920
InteractiveTel provides services
that capture and analyze

00:27:12.920 --> 00:27:14.640
business communications.

00:27:14.640 --> 00:27:17.420
A lot of the data we collect
is audio from the recording

00:27:17.420 --> 00:27:18.860
of phone calls.

00:27:18.860 --> 00:27:22.340
We have clients that accumulate
a quarter of a million minutes

00:27:22.340 --> 00:27:24.800
in one month of conversations.

00:27:24.800 --> 00:27:26.300
To put that in
perspective, it would

00:27:26.300 --> 00:27:31.070
take one person 173 days
of continuous listening

00:27:31.070 --> 00:27:33.082
to review every call.

00:27:33.082 --> 00:27:34.790
Now, normally those
recordings would just

00:27:34.790 --> 00:27:36.650
sit there until
something happened

00:27:36.650 --> 00:27:39.020
that caused a
particular conversation

00:27:39.020 --> 00:27:40.280
to come under scrutiny.

00:27:42.839 --> 00:27:44.630
When that conversation
went under scrutiny,

00:27:44.630 --> 00:27:47.390
it may be because of a
disgruntled customer or even

00:27:47.390 --> 00:27:48.920
a lawsuit.

00:27:48.920 --> 00:27:51.860
Services like the ones that
I'll show you today transfer

00:27:51.860 --> 00:27:55.850
information from a phone
call to CRM companies,

00:27:55.850 --> 00:28:01.010
to lead and contact management
systems, and even to managers,

00:28:01.010 --> 00:28:03.500
in the form of a text message
when something goes wrong.

00:28:08.590 --> 00:28:12.430
We're able to provide this
value by translating speech

00:28:12.430 --> 00:28:16.270
into text using Cloud
Speech API and provide value

00:28:16.270 --> 00:28:18.160
to our clients.

00:28:18.160 --> 00:28:20.890
Since the new services
we've been able to provide,

00:28:20.890 --> 00:28:24.790
we've been able to add 75
new accounts in 30 days

00:28:24.790 --> 00:28:28.735
and over 2,100 new opportunities
just from these new services.

00:28:34.010 --> 00:28:38.020
Let's talk a little bit about
the architecture that we use.

00:28:38.020 --> 00:28:39.850
From our telephony
infrastructure,

00:28:39.850 --> 00:28:44.350
we stream speech in real time
to Google's Cloud Speech API.

00:28:44.350 --> 00:28:46.300
We take the results
we got from Google

00:28:46.300 --> 00:28:49.420
and then pass them through our
analysis engine, which extracts

00:28:49.420 --> 00:28:53.200
sentiment, keywords, and
key phrases, all of which

00:28:53.200 --> 00:28:55.420
are used to construct an
understanding of what's

00:28:55.420 --> 00:28:57.430
happening on a call.

00:28:57.430 --> 00:28:59.500
We take our findings
and then publish

00:28:59.500 --> 00:29:02.560
them to CRM companies,
R data visualization

00:29:02.560 --> 00:29:05.769
tools, and other subscribers.

00:29:05.769 --> 00:29:07.810
They take that information
and then pass it along

00:29:07.810 --> 00:29:10.780
to managers, who can
intervene if necessary

00:29:10.780 --> 00:29:15.430
and analyze the data to
see what's happening.

00:29:15.430 --> 00:29:16.980
If we could go to
the laptop now?

