00:31:11.206 --> 00:31:12.830
So if you will, please
make some calls.

00:31:20.782 --> 00:31:24.758
[SIDE CONVERSATION]

00:31:38.059 --> 00:31:38.850
That's pretty cool.

00:31:46.730 --> 00:31:50.650
So this is using gRPC
to stream in real time

00:31:50.650 --> 00:31:52.140
